.TH ISKRA 1 "February 2026" "iskra 1.0.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
iskra \- intelligent multi-repository Git automation with AI-powered commits
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B iskra
[\fIOPTIONS\fR]
.br
.B iskra exec
[\fIOPTIONS\fR] \fICOMMAND\fR
.br
.B iskra init
[\fISUBCOMMAND\fR] [\fIOPTIONS\fR]
.br
.B iskra log
[\fIOPTIONS\fR]
.br
.B iskra info
.br
.B iskra clone
[\fIOPTIONS\fR]
.br
.B iskra gh
[\fISUBCOMMAND\fR] [\fIOPTIONS\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B iskra
is a powerful command-line tool for managing multiple Git repositories with
unprecedented efficiency. It combines intelligent repository tracking,
AI-powered commit message generation, and streamlined Git operations into
a single interface.
.PP
Key features include:
.IP \(bu 2
Batch operations across 100+ repositories
.IP \(bu 2
AI-powered conventional commit messages via Ollama, OpenAI, or Claude
.IP \(bu 2
Beautiful Rich terminal UI with progress indicators
.IP \(bu 2
Flexible filtering with glob patterns
.IP \(bu 2
Per-repository configuration overrides
.SH COMMANDS
.SS Main Commands
.TP
.B iskra
Process all tracked repositories: stage, commit with AI message, push.
.TP
.B iskra exec \fICOMMAND\fR
Run any shell command across all tracked repositories.
.TP
.B iskra init
Initialize configuration and scan for repositories.
.TP
.B iskra log
View git history for current repository with rich formatting.
.TP
.B iskra info
Display repository statistics with ASCII art (like onefetch).
.TP
.B iskra clone
Clone GitHub repositories in bulk.
.TP
.B iskra gh
GitHub-related operations (PRs, issues).
.SS Command Shortcuts
.TP
.B iskra status
Show status only (alias for --status-only)
.TP
.B iskra scan
Scan directory and show status (alias for --scan --status-only)
.TP
.B iskra pulse
Process current repository only (alias for --pulse)
.TP
.B iskra sync
Pull current repository (alias for --pull --pull-only --pulse -y)
.TP
.B iskra sync-all
Pull all tracked repositories (alias for --pull --pull-only -y)
.SH OPTIONS
.SS Operation Modes
.TP
.BR \-\-scan
Scan directory for repos instead of using tracked repos.
.TP
.BR \-\-pulse
Process current repository only.
.TP
.BR \-\-status-only
Show status without committing.
.TP
.BR \-\-pull-only
Only pull, don't commit or push.
.SS Git Operations
.TP
.BR \-\-pull
Pull before commit.
.TP
.BR \-\-no-push
Don't push after commit.
.TP
.BR \-\-no-ai-commit
Use manual commit message instead of AI.
.TP
.BR \-\-commit-message =\fIMSG\fR
Set custom commit message.
.SS Filtering
.TP
.BR \-\-only " \fIPATTERN\fR..."
Only include repos matching pattern (glob).
.TP
.BR \-\-exclude " \fIPATTERN\fR..."
Exclude repos matching pattern (glob).
.TP
.BR \-c ", " \-\-has-changes
Only repos with uncommitted changes.
.TP
.BR \-\-dirty
Only repos with untracked/modified files.
.TP
.BR \-\-clean
Only repos with no changes.
.TP
.BR \-\-behind-remote
Only repos behind remote (needs pull).
.TP
.BR \-\-ahead-remote
Only repos ahead of remote (needs push).
.TP
.BR \-\-on-branch " \fIBRANCH\fR..."
Only repos on specific branch.
.TP
.BR \-\-conflicts
Only repos with merge conflicts.
.SS Safety & Preview
.TP
.BR \-\-dry-run
Show what would be done without making changes.
.TP
.BR \-\-show-diff
Show diff before committing.
.TP
.BR \-y ", " \-\-yes
Skip all confirmation prompts.
.SS Output
.TP
.BR \-\-json
Output machine-readable JSON.
.TP
.BR \-q ", " \-\-quiet
Suppress Rich UI, minimal output.
.TP
.BR \-\-compact
Compact display for clean repositories.
.SS Configuration
.TP
.BR \-\-config =\fIPATH\fR
Use custom config file.
.TP
.BR \-\-dir =\fIPATH\fR
Override base directory.
.SH ISKRA EXEC
Run any command across all tracked repositories.
.SS Usage
.B iskra exec
[\fIOPTIONS\fR] "\fICOMMAND\fR"
.SS Options
.TP
.BR \-p ", " \-\-parallel =\fIN\fR
Run N commands in parallel (default: 1).
.TP
.BR \-\-fail-fast
Stop on first error.
.TP
.BR \-y ", " \-\-yes
Skip confirmation.
.TP
.BR \-q ", " \-\-quiet
Only show command output.
.SS Examples
.PP
Run git log on all repos:
.RS
.B iskra exec "git log --oneline -5"
.RE
.PP
Parallel npm install:
.RS
.B iskra exec -p 5 "npm install"
.RE
.PP
Fetch all with filter:
.RS
.B iskra exec --only "api-*" "git fetch --all"
.RE
.SH ISKRA INIT
Initialize configuration and manage tracked repositories.
.SS Subcommands
.TP
.B init
Scan directory and track repos interactively.
.TP
.B list, ls
List all tracked repositories.
.TP
.B add \fIPATH\fR
Add repository to tracking.
.TP
.B remove, rm \fIPATH\fR
Remove repository from tracking.
.SS Init Options
.TP
.BR \-\-base-dir =\fIPATH\fR
Directory to scan for repositories.
.TP
.BR \-y ", " \-\-yes
Accept all defaults.
.TP
.BR \-\-show-repos
Show repos after initialization.
.SS List Options
.TP
.BR \-\-all
Include inactive repositories.
.SH ISKRA LOG
View git history for current repository with rich formatting.
.SS Options
.TP
.BR \-n ", " \-\-count =\fIN\fR
Number of commits to show (default: 20).
.TP
.BR \-\-oneline
Compact one-line format.
.TP
.BR \-\-author =\fINAME\fR
Filter by author.
.TP
.BR \-\-since =\fIDATE\fR
Show commits after date.
.TP
.BR \-\-until =\fIDATE\fR
Show commits before date.
.TP
.BR \-\-grep =\fIPATTERN\fR
Search commit messages.
.TP
.BR \-\-graph
Show ASCII branch graph.
.TP
.BR \-\-all
Show commits from all branches.
.SH ISKRA INFO
Display repository statistics with ASCII art for the dominant language.
Shows language breakdown, lines of code, commits, contributors, and repo size.
.PP
Place an
.I icon.png
in the repository root for custom ASCII art.
.SH CONFIGURATION
.SS Global Configuration
Located at
.IR ~/.config/iskra/config.yaml :
.PP
.RS
.nf
base_dir: ~/Projects
auto_pull: true
auto_push: true
use_ai_commit: true
ai_provider: ollama  # or openai, claude
require_confirmation: true
.fi
.RE
.SS Per-Repository Configuration
Create
.I .iskra.yaml
in repository root:
.PP
.RS
.nf
use_ai_commit: false
auto_push: false
pre_commit_command: "npm test"
.fi
.RE
.SS Environment Variables
.TP
.B OLLAMA_MODEL
Ollama model to use (default: gemma)
.TP
.B OLLAMA_URL
Ollama API URL (default: http://127.0.0.1:11434)
.TP
.B OPENAI_API_KEY
OpenAI API key (if ai_provider: openai)
.TP
.B ANTHROPIC_API_KEY
Anthropic API key (if ai_provider: claude)
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.config/iskra/config.yaml
Global configuration
.TP
.I ~/.config/iskra/repos.json
Tracked repositories database
.TP
.I ~/.config/iskra/logs/
Operation logs
.TP
.I .iskra.yaml
Per-repository configuration
.SH EXIT STATUS
.TP
.B 0
Success
.TP
.B 1
Error (Git operation failed, invalid command, etc.)
.SH EXAMPLES
.PP
Process all tracked repositories:
.RS
.B iskra
.RE
.PP
Preview without making changes:
.RS
.B iskra --dry-run
.RE
.PP
Pull all repos:
.RS
.B iskra sync-all
.RE
.PP
Filter by pattern:
.RS
.B iskra --only "frontend-*" --show-diff
.RE
.PP
Run tests across all repos:
.RS
.B iskra exec "npm test"
.RE
.PP
Initialize and scan:
.RS
.B iskra init init --base-dir ~/Projects
.RE
.SH DEPENDENCIES
.SS Required
.IP \(bu 2
Python 3.8+
.IP \(bu 2
Git
.SS Optional
.IP \(bu 2
Ollama (for AI commit messages)
.IP \(bu 2
GitHub CLI (for clone and gh commands)
